            "created_at": "2025-08-02T23:29:39.919218+00:00",
            "notes": "Always start with   [To Me, My Friends!](item_9bd5bb9d-8026-4092-80c5-21e726c0969f)  [Heartbeat Sensor](item_2a4ffaf4-f14b-47d2-a267-0a0e83e87418) , [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) ,and [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)\n \nIf the enemy is  [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49) and takes  [Smashing!](item_a7021e28-cb8a-4f39-aeb1-380525b3fea9) this is ideal, and you should win most match ups. you might be thinking \"how do win if he has extra 10% move speed and 30% weapon lifesteal?\"Just like  [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) the stats only last for 2 seconds. Just swing on  [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49)  2 times then back away. It's just that easy. Since you can no longer have  [Wilhelmwagen](item_c6b943ef-1941-4979-81dd-8848a171326e) round 1 this matchup is not as simple as it was before but it is still good for you if you play it right. Just don't swing on  [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49) too much.\n\nTip: before this round starts you can let your team know that you are going shield build to incentivize them to go for a WP build.\n\nImportant note: you have to reach at least 10k after round 1 so you can afford [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7).",
