            "created_at": "2025-08-02T23:29:39.919218+00:00",
            "notes": "Absolutely must get  [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) .  [Heartbeat Sensor](item_2a4ffaf4-f14b-47d2-a267-0a0e83e87418) is best after that.  [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) is better than  [Heartbeat Sensor](item_2a4ffaf4-f14b-47d2-a267-0a0e83e87418),  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf), and  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) together. If you have between 13750-13999 get  [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054). At 14000 you could get  [Frenzy Amplifier](item_d4b0cfcb-14e9-4472-a688-680120217250) but I don't like that the stats are inconsistent, but they are good enough to replace  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and If you get crazy money just min/max WP. at 17500+ [Iron Eyes](item_f16d03a7-f20e-4a1d-a1f6-55863e163c03) could be good against guaranteed crits like  [Genji](hero_31fd201d-2f46-41e4-b125-9fa9e55fed46) melee build with  [Ambusher Optics](item_742c3c71-17cd-4fa7-bf18-ddeae7d521ca).",
