            "created_at": "2025-08-02T23:29:39.919218+00:00",
            "notes": "This is where we do a full pivot to turtle Reinhardt. Sell all of your items and buy  [Wilhelmwagen](item_c6b943ef-1941-4979-81dd-8848a171326e),  [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98),  [Overclocked Barrier](item_e82af99e-3116-4867-b8a4-52c7dfd1d7e9).  [Heartbeat Sensor](item_2a4ffaf4-f14b-47d2-a267-0a0e83e87418) and  [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) are still useful for movement speed. [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) is the best common option for this last slot. I don't think  [Phoenix Protocol](item_460fb24b-8422-43bb-9964-d296ef7c086c) is very good or necessary because  [Barrier Reconstruction](item_ecd5cf3c-0293-42e9-b015-0b00c25082f5) is so good. you can get like 300 barrier hp per swing/firestike HIT. so multiple hits can lead to 1000 hp in less than 1 second. firestrikes should be used for regenerating barrier hp and easy eliminations. there is no need to use then on airborne targets as not getting the elimination could cause your shield to break faster.",
